Subject: [PATCH] feat(chronik): persist separate bounded V2 branch index with
 atomic undo

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Persist a separate bounded V2 branch index with atomic block updates and exact undo records. The derived database provides snapshot query backing and rollback behavior, but is not wired into an enabled Chronik runtime.

